<title>USA: U.S. meat output 1.8 pct above a week ago - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output 1.8 pct above a week ago - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, June 28, 830.1 million lbs, up 1.8. - USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2  LAMB/MUTTON  TOTALS/3</p>
<p>28-Jun-97     505.0	6.4	 314.1	 4.6	 830.1</p>
<p>21-Jun-97     498.8	6.0	 306.0	 4.7	 815.5</p>
<p>Change:	   1.2%     6.7%	  2.7%     -2.1%	  1.8%</p>
<p>29-Jun-96     509.7	6.8	 289.7	 4.3	 810.5</p>
<p>Change:	  -0.9%    -5.9%	  8.4%	7.0%	  2.4%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:   12219.2    158.8	8090.4     127.0     20595.4</p>
<p>1996 YTD:   12690.4    172.0	8345.8     135.1     21343.3</p>
<p>Change:	  -3.7%    -7.7%	 -3.1%     -6.0%	 -3.5%</p>
